## Final command checklist

```
# Check network interfaces
ip addr

# Test connectivity
ping <OTHER_NODE_IP>

# Check cluster status
pvecm status

# List cluster nodes
pvecm nodes

# Monitor CPU and memory
top
```

Expected result: Two hypervisor hosts are configured as a cluster, cluster membership is verified, HA and workload distribution are configured, and VM migration is tested. Live migration and automatic failover require the appropriate storage, quorum, networking and HA setup.
